  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020440,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花、オシャレとか、わかんなくて……\r\nどんなのが千雪さんに似合うか、わかんないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020450,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "これ……色、とか……\r\nなんだか、千雪さんっぽいなって、思ったんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020450"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020460,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うんうん！　甜花ちゃんのその髪飾り、\r\n千雪さんにすっごく似合うと思うよ～☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020470,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それにそれに、甜花ちゃんが頑張って選んだんだもん\r\nきっと千雪さん、喜んでくれるって！",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020480,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nそうだと、良いな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020490,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも、ね……\r\nこの髪飾り、なんだか、もっと良くなりそうな気がして……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020500,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え、そうかな？　もうすっごくかわいーと思うけど……\r\nんー……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020510,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……あっ！　そうだ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020520,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ねえねえ甜花ちゃん、\r\n甜花ちゃんの見つけたやつに、甘奈が見つけた別の……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020520"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020530,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "これ！　千雪さんが見てたのとは全然違うかなって\r\n思ってたんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020530"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020540,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ほら、こうやってふたつ組み合わせたら、\r\nもっと良くなると思わない！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301500302/3015003020540"
  },
  {
    "id": 3015003020550,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ほんとだ……！　もっと、可愛くなった……！\r\nなーちゃん、すごい……！",
